<title>SWEDEN: ICB Shipping orders tanker from Daewoo.</title>
<headline>ICB Shipping orders tanker from Daewoo.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's ICB Shipping on Thursday said it had ordered a 158,000 DWT Suezmax tanker from South Korea's Daewoo yard with an option to buy one further tanker at the same price.</p>
<p>No price was given.</p>
<p>The vessel will be delivered in the middle of 1998, ICB Shipping said in a statement.</p>
<p>ICB Shipping controls a fleet of five Suezmax and six VLCCs tankers.</p>
<p>-- Stockholom newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
